  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Semuliki Cocoa Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Cocoa.Beneficiaries: 3008 small holder farmers of whom 1094 are women..Project funds will be used to pay for infrastructural development with construction of a central warehouse, equipment and materials for quality improvement, acquisition of a track and motorcycles, packaging materials, training of farmers and staff, staff salaries, marketing of members cocoa, as well as financial systems upgrade..</narrative>
